    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7258" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀν-απόδοτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not given back, not
				returned,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. δόσις ἡ δωρεά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Top.</u>
					125a18
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργύριον ἀ. δόντα</span>
			<i>not to be repaid</i>, <u>CIG</u>(add.) <i><span class="en">
				4278k
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Xanthus</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				4300o
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Limyra</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				105.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				171.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
					108.58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνανταπόδοτον</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				45.11
			</span></i>.</div>
